/ Order by a field no element has is an error naming the part and the field — never the list back unchanged.
Start
- variable.set(Name=%users%, Value=[{name: "a", age: 30}, {name: "b", age: 10}])
- list.query(List=%users%, Query={order: "agee"}); on.error(Key="FieldNotFound", Recovery=[goal.call(Name="Caught")]); variable.set(Name=%sorted%, Value=%!data%)
- assert.contains(Value="order: ", Container=%caught%, Message="the error names the part")
- assert.contains(Value="agee", Container=%caught%, Message="and the misspelled field")

Caught
- variable.set(Name=%caught%, Value=%!error.Message%)
